        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor U as Usuário (Web)\n    participant API as Backend API (Node.js)\n    participant DB as Banco de Dados (Prisma)\n    participant Mail as Serviço de Email\n    actor A as Admin (Web)\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;API: POST /api/chefs/apply { displayName, cnpj, docs }\n    activate API\n    API-&gt;&gt;DB: Cria \&quot;Chef\&quot; (status: PENDING) e \&quot;ChefDocument\&quot;\n    activate DB\n    DB--&gt;&gt;API: Confirma submissão\n    deactivate DB\n    API--&gt;&gt;U: Retorna 201 Created (Em análise)\n    deactivate API\n\n    Note over U, A: Dias depois, na área administrativa...\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;API: PUT /api/chefs/{id}/approve + Token Admin\n    activate API\n    API-&gt;&gt;DB: Atualiza \&quot;Chef\&quot; (status: APPROVED)\n    API-&gt;&gt;DB: Atualiza \&quot;User\&quot; (role: CHEF)\n    activate DB\n    DB--&gt;&gt;API: Confirma atualização\n    deactivate DB\n    API-&gt;&gt;Mail: POST Dispara email de boas-vindas\n    activate Mail\n    Mail--&gt;&gt;U: Entrega email \&quot;Conta de Chef Aprovada\&quot;\n    deactivate Mail\n    API--&gt;&gt;A: Retorna 200 OK\n    deactivate API&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="D3H9yPQnHZUQDlA0Cue2-1">
